Portions adapted from Ovis, Copyright (C) 2024 AIDC-AI, Apache-2.0.
Authoritative project: https://github.com/AIDC-AI/Ovis
Pinned release sources and SHA-256 digests: source_manifest.json and README.md.
The original Apache-2.0 license text is retained in LICENSE.

Changes: package-owned Transformers 5 configuration/model/processor binding;
explicit native Llama/Qwen2/Gemma2 and CLIP/SigLIP construction; preserved
released tensor prefixes and visual/formatter protocols; current cache,
attention and Gemma2 embedding-gain adaptation; safetensors-only publication;
conservative decoder-only plain-AWQ policy and independent CPU regressions.

Installed Hugging Face Transformers provides its native decoder and vision
implementations under Apache-2.0. No native model source is copied here.
No trained tensor payload or tokenizer vocabulary is redistributed here.
The licenses/conditions for underlying Llama, Gemma, Qwen, CLIP and SigLIP
weights, tokenizer assets and datasets remain separate and unchanged.
